<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Riviera Tool Co.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Riviera Tool Co.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Riviera Tool Co</p>
<p>Stock symbol			RTCO.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $7-$8/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    1.1 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 1.1 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    2,560,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    National Securities Corp</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  165,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Grand Rapids, Mich-based company designs, develops and manufactures custom large scale metal stamping die systems used in the high speed production of sheet metal stamped parts and assemblies for the automobile industry.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Reduction of financial institution debt, to acquire fixed assets, retirement of all outstanding eight percent cumulative preferred stock, and for general corporate working capital purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Aug 31:</p>
<p>				  1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Sales		   $22,225	    $22,425</p>
<p>   - Net Income  (loss)    $486		  ($39)</p>
